(23) The Enforcement Decree of the Act on Value Enhancement of Hanok and Other Architectural Assets is partially amended as follows:

In Article 6 (1) 3, "construction technology service business" shall be replaced with "construction engineering business".

(24) through (26) Omitted.

ADDENDA (Enforcement Decree of the Act on Repair of National Heritage, etc.) <Presidential Decree No. 34494, May 7, 2024>

Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
